contentText:
Jelly Roll and Bunnie Xo fans were left confused by comments the country star&#8217;s 18-year-old daughter, Bailee Ann, made in regard to the ex-couple&#8217;s recent divorce, which seemed to imply that there&#8217;s more to the story than the public realizes. But according to the podcaster, there&#8217;s nothing to clarify.

